WHAT THIS FIXES

This patch fixes:

- adds runtime JSON Schema validation for incoming ResultProposal at Post V&V boundary
- validates required fields through the active ResultProposal schema
- validates nested schema constraints through the active ResultProposal schema
- validates additionalProperties constraints through the active ResultProposal schema
- validates time_envelope/common refs through local schema store
- converts schema failures into normal V&V report path
- preserves manual policy/safety checks after schema validation


WHAT THIS DOES NOT FIX

This patch does not fix:

- does not validate outgoing VVReport at runtime
- does not align EvidenceItem.kind
- does not align artifact_type
- does not modify schemas
- does not modify GT
- does not modify Root
- does not modify DRS writeback
- does not claim production readiness
- does not claim public-auditor readiness
- does not close all findings

